}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "614896214401616", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57569440_614896217734949_1853449729855099356_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rwqZ1aG-CiYQ7kNvwEGTplZ&_nc_oc=AdrzEUOUAx-CuMpH2Lm0rvUXokn7L_6sb3-F98gNv_jL3tgCJ5PbB-xE2OfGv8BL5m4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHBU_JVEF52uaaQOLOSgOQ-zcz9kjTrl_f6TBrzXe5uYw&oe=6A95CAEA"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "1278069160104930", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391937_1278069163438263_1976513473908018454_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7MJd_jHFT2oQ7kNvwGBUHVf&_nc_oc=Ado0p66qVE-XsNobAYcSnRncHr7xANwo8AFJHLT481DQ6nkGgN9RHcRQ4JBmaw7bEHQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1O8wTCd7_5vtjA39K392tpZ2TGheN0CKSl7lNgr2baA&oe=6A95D25D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Next Hole - Golf Game", "keywords": ["Golf", "GolfGame", "Sports", "SportsGame"], "long_description": "\n\nNext Hole VR redefines golf with a cutting-edge virtual reality experience. Whether you're a seasoned golfer or a curious beginner, immerse yourself in breathtakingly realistic courses that transport you to serene landscapes, rolling fairways, and challenging greens.\n\nWith intuitive controls and lifelike physics, every swing, chip, and putt feels authentic. Compete against friends in multiplayer mode, hone your skills in solo challenges, or explore creative game modes that keep the action fresh and exciting.\n\nFrom mastering tricky sand traps to celebrating a triumphant hole-in-one, Next Hole VR is your ticket to a thrilling golf adventure. Grab your virtual clubs and take on the challenge\u2014because the next hole is waiting!", "short_description": "Step onto the greens in Next Hole VR, the ultimate immersive golf experience! Swing, aim, and putt your way through stunning virtual courses, challenging yourself to master the perfect shot."}